`getDay()` returns 0 for Sunday, never 7.

```js
export function isWeekend(date) {
  const d = date.getDay();
  return d === 0 || d === 6;
}
```

`getDay()` uses local time, so a UTC-midnight date like `new Date("2026-10-04")` can land on the previous day in negative-offset timezones; use `getUTCDay()` if your dates are UTC.
